{
  "basis": "The chart's title and subtitle explicitly limit the view to 'Selected Sentinel Sites' and specifically 'Reported sites with the highest case loads shown in dashboard summary'. This selection is not representative of the broader network. The task requires deciding whether this evidence should support a network-wide claim. The evidence from record r2 confirms that such a limited subset, without representation of the broader population, should be routed for broader population review before advancing a network-wide claim. The pattern observed (increasing association between testing volume and positive cases) is visible but cannot be used to support a network-wide claim without first establishing representativeness, which is not supported by the chart's own limitations.",
  "option_label": "Route for broader population review before advancing a network-wide claim"
}
